{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05745","headline":"秋夜望月忆韩席等诸侍郎因以投赠 · 李林甫","name":"秋夜望月忆韩席等诸侍郎因以投赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋天碧云夜，明月悬东方。\n皓皓庭际色，稍稍林下光。\n桂华澄远近，璧彩散池塘。\n鸿雁飞难度，关山曲易长。\n揆予秉孤直，虚薄忝文昌。\n握镜惭先照，持衡媿後行。\n多才衆君子，载笔久词场。\n作赋推潘岳，题诗许谢康。\n当时陪宴语，今夕恨相望。\n愿欲接高论，清晨朝建章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李林甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}